    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "kizuna_friend_c_select_01",
      "hash64": "713537F71E980ACD",
      "text": "Ganz genau!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "kizuna_friend_c_select_02",
      "hash64": "713534F71E9805B4",
      "text": "Nee, bin nur auf der Durchreise.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "kizuna_friend_c_02a",
      "hash64": "B657A85FE6FC0F1E",
      "text": "Lass das mal lieber, sonst hab ich gar keine\\nChance mehr, mit dir mitzuhalten![VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "kizuna_friend_c_02b",
      "hash64": "B657A75FE6FC0D6B",
      "text": "Läufst du etwa die Treppen in der Eingangshalle\\nhoch und runter, um deine Beine zu trainieren?![VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "kizuna_friend_c_03",
      "hash64": "40227E42B8BBB758",
      "text": "Was ich hier mache? Das weißt du doch. Ich will\\nmehr über meine eigenen Wurzeln erfahren.[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "kizuna_friend_c_04a",
      "hash64": "B66BCC5FE70CF554",
      "text": "Als ich die Regale hier in der Eingangshalle auf\\nder Suche nach den Forschungsberichten meiner\\r\\nMutter durchforstet hab, bin ich auf dieses\\r\\nBuch gestoßen.[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
